#: ../../src/dns.rst:5
msgid "DNS utility functions"
msgstr "DNS 工具函数"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:7
msgid "libuv provides asynchronous variants of `getaddrinfo` and `getnameinfo`."
msgstr "libuv 提供了 `getaddrinfo` 和 `getnameinfo` 的异步版本。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:11
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:15
msgid "`getaddrinfo` request type."
msgstr "`getaddrinfo` 请求类型。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:19
msgid ""
"Callback which will be called with the getaddrinfo request result once "
"complete. In case it was cancelled, `status` will have a value of "
"``UV_ECANCELED``."
msgstr "在 getaddrinfo 请求完成时，会携带该请求的结果被调用的回调。如果请求被取消，`status` 的值将为 ``UV_ECANCELED``。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:25
msgid "`getnameinfo` request type."
msgstr "`getnameinfo` 请求类型。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:29
msgid ""
"Callback which will be called with the getnameinfo request result once "
"complete. In case it was cancelled, `status` will have a value of "
"``UV_ECANCELED``."
msgstr "在 getnameinfo 请求完成时，会携带该请求的结果被调用的回调。如果请求被取消，`status` 的值将为 ``UV_ECANCELED``。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:35
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:39
msgid ""
"Loop that started this getaddrinfo request and where completion will be "
"reported. Readonly."
msgstr "启动该 getaddrinfo 请求的事件循环，完成情况也将报告到该事件循环。只读。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:44
msgid ""
"Pointer to a `struct addrinfo` containing the result. Must be freed by "
"the user with :c:func:`uv_freeaddrinfo`."
msgstr "指向包含结果的 `struct addrinfo` 的指针。必须由用户通过 :c:func:`uv_freeaddrinfo` 释放。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:47 ../../src/dns.rst:58 ../../src/dns.rst:64
msgid "the field is declared as public."
msgstr "该字段被声明为公开字段。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:51
msgid ""
"Loop that started this getnameinfo request and where completion will be "
"reported. Readonly."
msgstr "启动该 getnameinfo 请求的事件循环，完成情况也将报告到该事件循环。只读。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:56
msgid "Char array containing the resulting host. It's null terminated."
msgstr "包含所得主机名的字符数组。以空字节结尾。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:62
msgid "Char array containing the resulting service. It's null terminated."
msgstr "包含所得服务名的字符数组。以空字节结尾。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:66
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_req_t` members also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_req_t` 的成员也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:70
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:74
msgid "Asynchronous :man:`getaddrinfo(3)`."
msgstr "异步版的 :man:`getaddrinfo(3)`。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:76
msgid "Either node or service may be NULL but not both."
msgstr "node 和 service 可以有一个为 NULL，但不能两者都为 NULL。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:78
msgid ""
"`hints` is a pointer to a struct addrinfo with additional address type "
"constraints, or NULL. Consult `man -s 3 getaddrinfo` for more details."
msgstr "`hints` 是指向带有额外地址类型约束的 struct addrinfo 的指针，或为 NULL。更多细节请查阅 `man -s 3 getaddrinfo`。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:81
msgid ""
"Returns 0 on success or an error code < 0 on failure. If successful, the "
"callback will get called sometime in the future with the lookup result, "
"which is either:"
msgstr "成功时返回 0，失败时返回小于 0 的错误码。如果成功，回调将在将来某个时刻携带查找结果被调用，查找结果为以下两者之一："

#: ../../src/dns.rst:85
msgid "status == 0, the res argument points to a valid `struct addrinfo`, or"
msgstr "status == 0，res 参数指向一个有效的 `struct addrinfo`，或"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:86
msgid "status < 0, the res argument is NULL. See the UV_EAI_* constants."
msgstr "status < 0，res 参数为 NULL。参见 UV_EAI_* 常量。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:88
msgid "Call :c:func:`uv_freeaddrinfo` to free the addrinfo structure."
msgstr "调用 :c:func:`uv_freeaddrinfo` 来释放 addrinfo 结构体。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:90 ../../src/dns.rst:105
msgid ""
"the callback parameter is now allowed to be NULL, in which case the "
"request will run **synchronously**."
msgstr "回调参数现在允许为 NULL，此时请求将 **同步** 运行。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:95
msgid "Free the struct addrinfo. Passing NULL is allowed and is a no-op."
msgstr "释放 struct addrinfo。允许传入 NULL，此时为空操作。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:99
msgid "Asynchronous :man:`getnameinfo(3)`."
msgstr "异步版的 :man:`getnameinfo(3)`。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:101
msgid ""
"Returns 0 on success or an error code < 0 on failure. If successful, the "
"callback will get called sometime in the future with the lookup result. "
"Consult `man -s 3 getnameinfo` for more details."
msgstr "成功时返回 0，失败时返回小于 0 的错误码。如果成功，回调将在将来某个时刻携带查找结果被调用。更多细节请查阅 `man -s 3 getnameinfo`。"

#: ../../src/dns.rst:108
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_req_t` API functions also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_req_t` 的 API 函数也同样适用。"

